    "origin": "docs/DECISIONS.md line 15 (Service SLO, declared 14 Nov 2026): per request TTFT <= 2 s (1,000-token prompts) and TPOT <= 50 ms; distribution: p99 time between tokens <= 100 ms. The historical open-loop runs applied only the two request limits (runbook/serving_openloop.sh); this object applies all three.",
    "request_predicate": {
     "require_success": true,
     "ttft_ms_max": 2000,
     "tpot_ms_max": 50,
